+(a-runtime-you-can-build-on)=
+# Python dependency injection and dependency graph runtime
+
+**Melder — a runtime you can build on.**
+
+Melder is a dependency graph runtime for Python 3.14+. It wires ordinary
+Python classes, functions, and instances into a live graph using constructor
+dependency injection, explicit object lifetimes, and scoped cleanup.
 Start with a small application. Grow into connected subsystems, isolated worlds,
 and agent-operated infrastructure when you need them.
 
